Vibhīṣaṇa joins fray splitting demons like thunder on mountains --- Vibhīṣaṇa urges monkeys one prop of Rāvaṇa remains --- Vibhīṣaṇa recalls slain Prahasta Kumbhakarṇa and other mighty chiefs --- Vibhīṣaṇa grieves killing nephew but leaves him to Lakṣmaṇa --- Monkeys rejoice lashing tails as Jāmbavān pounds demons --- Demons surround Jāmbavān as Hanumān uproots Sāla slaughtering thousands --- Indrajit leaves uncle and rushes Lakṣmaṇa showering masses --- Both hide in arrow nets like sun and moon in clouds --- Lakṣmaṇa pierces four horses and beheads moving driver --- Monkeys crush horses and chariot then Lakṣmaṇa checks rushing foot foe
